⚡️ Meet Tron 2, a robot from China-based LimX Dynamics that can change its body for different jobs.

It can use a fixed base for precise tasks, a wheeled-leg base to carry heavy loads, or two legs to walk and climb stairs. The arms and brain stay the same, while the lower body changes depending on the mission.

@aipost 🏴

❗️Elon Musk’s SpaceXAI team will livestream itself building a company from scratch using Grok Bot in just 3 DAYS.

From September 15–17, three employees will use Grok Bot for ideation, planning, product decisions and engineering, testing whether AI agents can turn a blank idea into a working startup in 72 hours.

